# Generated BY contextkeel when run on itself. Derived, not source:
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored rule matches at any depth,
# and with core.ignorecase=true on macOS `Vault/` silently excluded the
# whole src/contextkeel/vault/ package from git.
# `ckeel init` recreates all of it. Committing it would invite hand-edits
# that the render engine then reports as drift.
/.claude/
/.cursor/
/.continue/
/Vault/
/AGENTS.md
/.mcp.json
